ife around it and you can put  a plant inside you can use them for  decor if you have the ones with the lid  you can store things inside great way  dish soap bottles I already had a  plastic dish soap bottle and rather than  throwing it away and just creating more  waste  I just reused it for my own home  Shampoo I am looking into cloth I  already caught Duggar but I'm gonna look  into using cloth wipes and I seen that  you can use a solution basically you  just spray it on to the cloth wipes so  maybe I'll just reuse them for that as  well if you have small spray bottles or  dropper bottles and you're wondering  what you can do with those you can use  them to make hand sanitizers or mosquito  repellent I have this one that I used to  have like an Omega vitamin in it or  something like that and I basically plan  on making mosquito repellent I just  don't have all the essential oils that I  need so it's not done yet  you can also repurpose any small cloth  bags that you may have at home I have  two other larger baggies that are like  this which is where I put my  undergarments in this one I think was  like a from a state park that we had  little rocks in and I basically use them  to put my hair bands and hair ties in so  what about plastic containers a lot of  times we can't avoid plastic containers  my husband loves a particular kind of  yogurt and so we are stuck with a whole  bunch of these containers so what I do  with them is I use them for whenever we  gift food to others or we also have  chickens so I just put eggs inside and I  give them away in this way I also on the  occasion that I do have a collection of  trash bags I don't just throw them away  I reuse them and so I keep them in here  keep them handy small plastic boxes you  can find ways to organize things around  your house for example I have this used  to be a flashlight box then I keep in  our office drawer where we just have our  pens and pencils inside and it keeps  them tidy we also make our own  